# Unit tests parallel structure

## Folder structure

- Source: `astropack/Matlab` (or `matlab/`)
- Tests: `astropack/MatlabTests` — hierarchy mirrors source exactly

## Naming

- Test files start with `Test`
- One test class per source file
- Inherit from `matlab.unittest.TestCase`

## Scope

Unit tests cover deterministic functions, core algorithms, data transforms.

Do not unit-test App Designer GUIs, long-running workers, or external services in this pattern.

## File I/O in tests

- Temporary folders only
- Never depend on production paths
- Clean up after execution

## Time and randomness

- No wall-clock dependencies
- Fix random seeds explicitly

## Output expectations

- Prefer clarity over coverage tricks
- Make failures easy to diagnose
